  },
  {
    "key": "DECIMAL VOICES |",
    "kind": "text",
    "group": "Concept"
  },
  {
    "key": "THE NEXT DECIMAL",
    "kind": "text",
    "group": "Concept"
  },
  {
    "key": "“The universe is an absolute totality of Cosmic Precision.”",
    "kind": "text",
    "group": "Concept"
  },
  {
    "key": "Sacred & foundational rationales",
    "kind": "text",
    "group": "Concept"
  },
  {
    "key": "SURAH AL-QAMAR 54:49",
    "kind": "text",
    "group": "Concept"
  },
  {
    "key": "إِنَّا كُلَّ شَيْءٍ خَلَقْنَاهُ بِقَدَرٍ",
    "kind": "text",
    "group": "Concept"
  },
  {
    "key": "“Indeed, all things We created with predetermined measure.”",
    "kind": "text",
    "group": "Concept"
  },
  {
    "key": "SURAH AR-RAHMAN 55:7",
    "kind": "text",
    "group": "Concept"
  },
  {
    "key": "وَالسَّمَاءَ رَفَعَهَا وَوَضَعَ الْمِيزَانَ",
    "kind": "text",
    "group": "Concept"
  },
  {
    "key": "“And the heaven He raised and imposed the balance.”",
    "kind": "text",
    "group": "Concept"
  },
  {
    "key": "SURAH AS-SAJDAH 32:7",
    "kind": "text",
    "group": "Concept"
  },
  {
    "key": "الَّذِي أَحْسَنَ كُلَّ شَيْءٍ خَلَقَهُ",
    "kind": "text",
    "group": "Concept"
  },
  {
    "key": "“Who perfected everything which He created.”",
    "kind": "text",
    "group": "Concept"
  },
  {
    "key": "The epistemic mandate: beyond approximations",
    "kind": "text",
    "group": "Concept"
  },
  {
    "key": "The universe operates on absolute cosmic precision, not approximations. From galactic orbits and gravitational equilibrium to subatomic interactions and cellular differentiation, everything in nature is governed by microscopic measurements. These calculations never end in an integer; rather, they unfold dynamically across infinite fractional dimensions.",
    "kind": "text",
    "group": "Concept"
  },
  {
    "key": "Truth resides not in “rounding off” realities, but in the epistemic curiosity to search for the next decimal. Complex human conditions, ethical decisions, and artistic endeavors should not be flattened into coarse averages and convenient approximations.",
    "kind": "text",
    "group": "Concept"
  },
  {
    "key": "The primary academic objectives",
    "kind": "text",
    "group": "Concept"
  },
  {
    "key": "[OBJ // 0",
    "kind": "text",
    "group": "Concept"
  },
  {
    "key": "“Scroll less. Measure more. The next decimal is where the noise ends and the signal begins.”",
    "kind": "text",
    "group": "Concept"
  },
